start: mr
R1: C1@{3ch {3ch dc [3ch dc]x7}@ring} ss@top fo # 8 dc, 8 ch-3 sps
R2: C2@{ch [{sc hdc 3dc hdc sc}@sp]x8} ss@top fo
R3: C3@{ch sc [5ch 6sk sc]x7 5ch} ss@top # "skip next 4 sts", but the sc goes in the centre dc of the next petal, 6 sts on
R4: C3@{sl@sp 3ch=dc {2dc 2ch 3dc}@same [ch 3dc@sp ch {3dc 2ch 3dc}@sp]x3 ch 3dc@sp ch} ss@top fo
R5: C4@{3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@same [[dc]>corner {2dc 2ch 2dc}@corner]x3 [dc]>end} ss@top fo
R6: C5@{2ch=hdc {hdc 2ch 2hdc}@same [[hdc]>corner {2hdc 2ch 2hdc}@corner]x3 [hdc]>end} ss@top fo
